  "content": "[Intro]\n[E]\n\n[Chorus]\n[B]Good day\n[F#]sunshine, [B]\n[B]Good day\n[F#]sunshine, [B]\n[E7]Good day\nsunshine. I need to\n\n[Verse 1]\n[A]laugh, [F#7]and when the\n[B7]sun is out\n[E7]I've got something I can\n[A]laugh about, I feel good,\n[A][F#7]in a spe-\n[B7]cial way.\n[E7]I'm in love and it's a\n[A]sunny day.\n\n[Chorus]\n[B]Good day\n[F#]sunshine, [B]\n[B]Good day\n[F#]sunshine, [B]\n[E7]Good day\nsunshine. We take a\n\n[Verse 2]\n[A]walk, [F#7]the sun is\n[B7]shining down,\n[E7]Burns my feet as they touch\n[A]the ground.\n\n[Solo]\n[D]  [B7]\n[E7]\n[A7]\n[D]\n\n[Chorus]\n[B]Good day\n[F#]sunshine, [B]\n[B]Good day\n[F#]sunshine, [B]\n[E7]Good day\nsunshine. And then we\n\n[Verse 3]\n[A]lie, [F#7]beneath a\n[B7]shady tree,\n[E7]I love her and she's lov-\n[A]ing me. She feels good,\n[A][F#7]she knows she's\n[B7]looking fine.\n[E7]I'm so proud to know that\n[A]she is mine.\n\n[Chorus]\n[B]Good day\n[F#]sunshine, [B]\n[B]Good day\n[F#]sunshine, [B]\n[E7]Good day\nsunshine.\n\n[Chorus]\n[B]Good day\n[F#]sunshine, [B]\n[B]Good day\n[F#]sunshine, [B]\n[E7]Good day\nsunshine,\n\n[Outro]\n[F]Good day sun-\nshine.\nGood day sun-\nshine.",
